-09","game":{"kind":"mcq","art":"wound","cards":[{"id":"M3N2_A","label":{"en":"Arrange urine monitoring first; revisit the meatal bleeding later.","th":"จัด urine monitoring ก่อน แล้วทบทวน meatal bleeding ภายหลัง"},"icon":"team"},{"id":"M3N2_B","label":{"en":"Request a drainage plan based on meatal bleeding without further evaluation.","th":"ขอ drainage plan จาก meatal bleeding โดยยังไม่ประเมินเพิ่ม"},"icon":"team"},{"id":"M3N2_C","label":{"en":"Raise suspected urethral injury and seek the senior evaluation plan.","th":"รายงาน suspected urethral injury และขอ senior evaluation plan"},"icon":"team"}],"targets":["M3N2_C"],"instruction":{"en":"Choose one team action, then confirm.","th":"เลือก action ของทีม 1 ข้อ แล้วกดยืนยัน"},"alt":{"en":"Fictional teaching scene, not a diagnostic image","th":"ฉากสอนจำลอง ไม่ใช่ภาพวินิจฉัย"},"mistake":"review_key_evidence"}},{"id":"M3N3_R","parentNodeId":"M3N3","stem":"The draft plan covers the ring injury but leaves out the wound and meatal bleeding. What would you add?","options":[{"id":"M3N3_R_PASS","text":"Corrected","explanation":"Keep trauma priorities active while the senior team coordinates appropriate specialists and the local open-injury pathway."},{"id":"M3N3_R_MISS","text":"Review again","explanation":"Keep trauma priorities active while the senior team coordinates appropriate specialists and the local open-injury pathway."}],"correctOptionId":"M3N3_R_PASS","resourceId":"R5","conceptIds":[],"outcomeIds":["O2","O4"],"workedExample":"Keep trauma priorities active while the senior team coordinates appropriate specialists and the local open-injury pathway.","contentVersion":"ptd-minigame-focused-2026-10-09","game":{"kind":"mcq","art":"wound","cards":[{"id":"M3N3_A","label":{"en":"Focus on orthopaedic classification before discussing the wound and urine.","th":"เน้น orthopaedic classification ก่อนหารือแผลและปัสสาวะ"},"icon":"team"},{"id":"M3N3_B","label":{"en":"Coordinate ongoing trauma care with urgent wound and urinary assess