ified?","suggestedFeedback":"Start with the observations, distinguish concern from confirmed source, and request senior support.","sources":["Handout: initial assessment","slides: emergency management"]},"explanationBeforeChoices":false,"stage":"practice","objectiveIds":["LO2","LO5"],"game":{"kind":"mcq","art":"blood","cards":[{"id":"M1N1_A","label":{"en":"Pelvic pain needs assessment; first establish the fracture pattern.","th":"ต้องประเมิน pelvic pain โดยระบุ fracture pattern ก่อน"},"icon":"team"},{"id":"M1N1_B","label":{"en":"Possible major haemorrhage needs urgent team assessment and support.","th":"สงสัย major haemorrhage ต้องเรียกทีมช่วยประเมินเร่งด่วน"},"icon":"team"},{"id":"M1N1_C","label":{"en":"A pelvic injury is likely; first establish whether the ring is stable.","th":"สงสัย pelvic injury โดยยืนยัน ring stability ก่อน"},"icon":"team"}],"targets":["M1N1_B"],"instruction":{"en":"Choose one team action, then confirm.","th":"เลือก action ของทีม 1 ข้อ แล้วกดยืนยัน"},"alt":{"en":"Fictional teaching scene, not a diagnostic image","th":"ฉากสอนจำลอง ไม่ใช่ภาพวินิจฉัย"},"mistake":"review_key_evidence"},"translation":{"title":{"en":"What would you tell your senior now?","th":"คุณจะรายงานอาจารย์อย่างไรตอนนี้?"},"story":{"en":"A 24-year-old motorcyclist arrives 35 minutes after injury. The airway is patent; pelvic pain and cool peripheries accompany HR 132/min and BP 82/50 mmHg. Your senior asks for the immediate concern.","th":"ผู้ป่วยอายุ 24 ปีจากอุบัติเหตุจักรยานยนต์ มาถึงหลังบาดเจ็บ 35 นาที Airway ยัง patent มี pelvic pain และปลายมือเท้าเย็น HR 132/min, BP 82/50 mmHg อาจารย์ถามถึงข้อกังวลเร่งด่วน"},"key":{"en":"Hypotension, tachycardia and cool peripheries raise an urgent haemorrhage concern; the source is not yet established.","th":"Hypotension, tachycardia และปลายมือเท้าเย็นทำให้สงสัย haemorrhage เร่งด่วน โดยยังไม่ทราบแหล่งเลือดออก"},"why":{"en":"Start with the observations, distinguish concern from confirmed source, and request senior support.","th":"Hypotension, tachycardia และปลายมือเท้าเย็นทำให้สงสัย haemorrhage เร่งด่วน โดยยังไม่ทราบแหล่งเลือดออก"}}},{"id":"M1N2","caseId":"case-unstable","missionId":"mission-1","outcomeIds":["O4"],"conceptIds":["S1"],"safetyFlag":true,"stem":"BP remains 82/50 mmHg. The senior trauma team is responding while the primary survey continues. You are asked to communicate the immediate priorities.","factsAvailableNow":["Concerning physiology persists","Other threats and bleeding sites remain under assessment"],"vitals":[{"label":"BP","value":"82/50 mmHg"}],"textAlternative":"Use the stated case evidence. Teaching examples are not images of this fictional patient.","question":"Which priorities would you communicate?","options":[{"id":"M1N2_PASS","text":"Appropriate team action","explanation":"Primary survey, trauma/haemorrhage support and indicated temporary stabilization proceed together."},{"id":"M1N2_MISS","text":"Review and correct","explanation":"Primary survey, trauma/haemorrhage support and indicated temporary stabilization proceed together."}],"correctOptionIds":["M1N2_PASS"],"resourceIds":["R2"],"retryId":"M1N2_R","nextNodeId":"M1N3","contentVersion":"ptd-minigame-focused-2026-10-09","responseMode":"single","rationalePrompt":"Optional note","confidenceOptions":["low","medium","high"],"acceptedConditions":[],"referenceIds":["BOAST-2018","WSES-2017","LOCAL-PATHWAY-PENDING"],"assetId":null,"scenePhase":"Team response","rationaleRequired":false,"interaction":"action","visuals":[],"teaching":{"objective":"Parallel trauma priorities","keyMessage":"Assessment, resuscitation and senior escalation proceed in parallel.","misconception":"Waiting for a completed pelvic assessment before resuscitation","discussionPrompt":"Compare a sequential plan with parallel assessment and support.","suggestedFeedback":"Name what continues now and what needs senior coordination.","sources":["Handout: emergency management"]},"explanationBeforeChoices":false,"stage":"practice","objectiveIds":["LO5","LO7"],"game